Package: codex-desktop
Version: __VERSION__
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Minh Vu <vuhoangminh97@gmail.com>
Depends: curl, g++, git, make, python3, unzip, xdg-utils
Recommends: 7zip | p7zip-full, desktop-file-utils, hicolor-icon-theme, libnotify-bin
Description: Electron desktop bootstrap package for Ubuntu
 This package installs the Electron-first desktop launcher and local build
 bootstrap tooling for Ubuntu.
 It does not ship the upstream desktop payload inside the package.
 Run codex-desktop-bootstrap after install to build and install the local
 desktop payload for the current user.
